WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.201
Welcome to the wonderful world of Connie.

2
00:00:03.201 --> 00:00:10.723
In this short lesson, I'll show you how easy it is to get help from the Connie Care Team using the built-in Support Ticketing system.

3
00:00:10.723 --> 00:00:16.333
You can access the ticketing system by clicking the Get Support button you see in the information panel.

4
00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:20.122
Once you arrive at the Support Center, you have a few options.

5
00:00:20.122 --> 00:00:25.693
In this lesson we're focused on opening a new ticket, so simply click Create New Ticket.

6
00:00:25.693 --> 00:00:30.111
To save you time, Connie fills in your name and email automatically.

7
00:00:30.111 --> 00:00:32.120
Just confirm they're correct.

8
00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:38.202
Then add a brief description of what's going on, along with any helpful details, and click Send.

9
00:00:38.202 --> 00:00:39.229
That's it!

10
00:00:39.229 --> 00:00:45.520
You'll see an on-screen confirmation with your ticket number, and you'll receive an email confirmation shortly.

11
00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:48.654
If you don't see it, be sure to check your spam folder.

12
00:00:48.654 --> 00:00:52.221
The Connie Care Team will respond as quickly as possible.

13
00:00:52.221 --> 00:00:56.876
You can monitor your ticket's progress any time by returning to the Get Support page.

14
00:00:56.876 --> 00:01:01.006
From here, click See all tickets to view everything for your account.

15
00:01:01.006 --> 00:01:03.918
Just switch the filter to All to see them all.

16
00:01:03.918 --> 00:01:08.704
Or look up a single ticket instantly by typing its number into the Track box.

17
00:01:08.704 --> 00:01:13.633
Just like that, you have direct access to the Connie Care Team, right from your Connie account.

18
00:01:13.633 --> 00:01:15.667
Thanks for using Connie.

19
00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:18.648
We can't wait to see all the amazing things you do with it.

